  "body": "This PR removes the reference implementation and the tests associated with it. The reference implementation for this standard is fairly un-maintained and hasn't been updated in a while. My understanding is that no implementations really use it as a reference to see how their console interface should act or look, so I think it is reasonable to remove this from the repository.\r\n\r\nThis will also fix #152, which is about updating one of the reference implementation dependencies.",
